  "details": "<p>The <em>tribus Pollia</em> presumably extended from the Tiber river to the Via Salaria and Fidenae. In this area a municipality, known as Ager Latinus or Latiniensis, was organised after the Social War.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The tribus Pollia was one of the older rural tribes of Rome.",
